    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After these things I saw, and behold, a door opened in heaven, and the first voice that I heard, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " as of a trumpet speaking with me, one saying, Come up hither, and I will show thee the things which must come to pass hereafter. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Straightway I was in the Spirit: and behold, there was a throne set in heaven, and one sitting upon the throne; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he that sat ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to look upon like a jasper stone and a sardius: and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " a rainbow round about the throne, like an emerald to look upon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And round about the throne ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " four and twenty thrones: and upon the thrones ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " four and twenty elders sitting, arrayed in white garments; and on their heads crowns of gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And out of the throne proceed lightnings and voices and thunders. And ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " seven lamps of fire burning before the throne, which are the seven Spirits of God; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and before the throne, as it were a sea of glass like unto crystal; and in the midst of the throne, and round about the throne, four living creatures full of eyes before and behind. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the first creature ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " like a lion, and the second creature like a calf, and the third creature had a face as of a man, and the fourth creature ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " like a flying eagle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the four living creatures, having each one of them six wings, are full of eyes round about and within: and they have no rest day and night, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
